1 NAME Karl Johan /Bruno/
2 GIVN Karl Johan
2 _MARNM Bruno
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 JUN 1800
2 ADDR
3 STAE Jönköping County
3 CTRY Sweden
