1 NAME Carolina Fredrika Gunilda /Bruno/ twin
2 GIVN Carolina Fredrika Gunilda
2 SURN Bruno
2 NSFX twin
2 _MARNM de Frese
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 6 FEB 1839
