1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Fake image of Jonas Laurentii.''' A fake image of Jonas Laurentii, without source, is on many online family trees, including this website. He is actually Enevald Svenonius,1617-1688. The print is at Uppsala univ
2 CONC ersitetsbibliotek,
2 CONT https://www.alvin-portal.org/alvin/view.jsf?pid=alvin-record:154613
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
