1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mitochondrial DNA: haplogroup T1a1 from mtDNA Full Sequence, Family Tree DNA kit 1028906, John Gregory Schannach
2 CONT --------
2 CONT Beata Jönsdotter'
2 CONT Also Known As:	 Ulfonia, Ulfonius & 
2 CONT 'Beata Johansdotter Ulfonis (Jönsdotter)'
2 CONT * Född:	cirka 1570 Södra Ving, Västergötland, Sverige 
2 CONT * Död:	1644 (69-77) Prästgården, Södra Ving, Västergötland, Sverige 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dotter till Johannes Ulfonis och Ingegerd Olofsdotter Bagge  
2 CONT * Hustru till Haqvin Benedicti  
2 CONT * Moder till Elias Haqvini; Estrid Håkansdotter; Anna Håkansdotter Winge; Bengt Haqvini; Christina Håkansdotter; Beata Håkansdotter och Sara Håkansdotter  
2 CONT * Syster till Sara Ulfonis 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.swedenroots.se/about/my_family_tree/pfa4c23cd.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT  (~1574 - 1644).
2 CONT
2 CONT Beata JÖNSDOTTER was born about 1574 in Södra Wing, Älvsborg län (Väster Götaland), Sweden. She died in 1644 at the age of 70 in Södra Wing, Älvsborg län (Väster Götaland), Sweden.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Beata Jönsdotter'''. Kyrkoherdedotter i Södra Ving. Hustru 1592 i Södra Ving. Död 1644 i Södra Ving. Gift.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://nweb.hardell.net/ppl/4/0/d148ce38c981c703cb0fa5c2b04.html
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://tree.bytecode.se/individual.php?pid=I11815&ged=Bytecode ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT Biography (from "Skara stifts herdaminne"), Åhs Härad parish: "Haqvin. Benedicti became pastor in 1596 . . . married to the predecessor's [Joh. Ulfonis'] daughter Beata Jönsdotter, died in 1644. From them descends the Winge family
2 CONC ."
2 CONT -- Johan Wilhelm Warholm, "Skara stifts herdaminne" (1874), p. 480, https://runeberg.org/skarahe2/0485.html and https://runeberg.org/skarahe2/0486.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Allan Anderson notes:
2 CONT At about 18 years when Christina gave birth to 1592, so she'd have been born circa 1574. Which means that she lived until around 70 years old. She would then be at least 23 years when Elias is given birth to her.
