1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://runeberg.org/statskal/1925/1105.html
2 CONT https://runeberg.org/statskal/1931/0449.html
2 CONT https://runeberg.org/statskal/1940/0499.html
2 CONT https://runeberg.org/statskal/1942/0506.html
2 CONT https://runeberg.org/statskal/1945/0497.html
