2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------
2 CONT Ingebord Nilsdotter, born 1565 Östanbäck (Ostvik) 10, Skellefteå, married to Ambrosius Andersson Burman, born 1560 Bureå. Daughter of Nils Hansson from Östanbäck 10. She is a Bure descendant (through her mother) married to another
2 CONC  Bure descendant (Sikeborg).
2 CONT
2 CONT  "From printed adaptations She died at Christmas time 1644 at the latest, when Nils Ambrosson and his siblings gave to the church after their mother. Carlsson (1989), pp. 37, 49"
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Marc Hernelind, "Bure Släkten" (Bure Family), page 40 281 
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Nilsdotter-6649
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 558360 gives source Bure/s153/93 for birth.
2 CONT Urban Sikeborg, "Johan Bures släktbok" USB (2017), person ID 1088.
2 CONT Carl Henrik Carlsson (1989), cited by Sikeborg.
