1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth:  Mar. 21, 1918  Death:  Dec. 18, 1969 Ong Clay County Nebraska, USA 
2 CONT
2 CONT C.Howard Benson, 51, died at his home In the Ong community Thursday. Born and reared in the area,he was a member of the Federated Church of Sutton.  Survivors are his wife Helen; daughters, Mrs Carol Ann Mellott of Superior, Suzan
2 CONC n Yost of Lincoln and Miss Barbara Benson of the home; his mother, Mrs. Ellen Benson of Salina, Kan., and brothers, Everett Beason of Shickley and Merrill Benson of Ong. Services will be held in the Federated Church of Sutton, wit
2 CONC h the time yet to be determined, and burial will be In the Ong Cemetery. The Urbauer Funeral Home of Davenport is in charge.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hastings Tribune December 18, 1969. 
