2 CONC itage Family Trees] via sister [http://www.geni.com/profile-64931999 Maria Tingstedt (born Andersdotter)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 18 2015, 4:30:58 UTC''
