1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anders Bergdahl, uppbördsman i Gruvad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans död: 73 år: Laske-Vedum (R) C:1 (1710-1791) Bild 155 / sid 302 (AID: v9656.b155.s302, NAD: SE/GLA/13317).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Var han gift två gånger ???
2 CONT
2 CONT Vem är mamma till vilka barn ??? KOLLAS ! ! !
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------
2 CONT Marriage to Annika Björck 1716-12-30. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mantalslängder (tax rolls) show that in 1720 and 1722 the collector Anders Bergdahl lived at Gruvad, Laske-Vedum.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders died 1765 in Laske-Vedum parish, Rustmästare (Armorer in Swedish Army), at Gruvad at the age of 73 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note that his FamilySearch profile (G6R7-78R) shows a second marriage to Catarina Lundbäck (b. 1710, d. 1790-09-17) with one son Andreas Bergdahl b. 1757-02-25. See https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/details/G6R7-78R
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Laske-Vedum Marriage, 1716-12-30, C:1.342, https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0051333_00185
2 CONT Named as parent in daughter Christina Bergdahl's baptism Laske-Vedums kyrkoarkiv, Födelse- och dopböcker, C:1.302 (1710-1791), https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0051333_00165
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Anders-Bergdahl/6000000038649154866
2 CONT Anders Burial record, Laske-Vedum parish, C:1.302  (1710-1791, SE/GLA/13317/C/1 https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0051333_00165
2 CONT Skaraborg Mantalslängder, SE/RA/55203/55203.16/59 (1720), bildid: A0006616_00231, p. 450 and SE/RA/55203/55203.16/61 (1722), bildid: A0006618_00242, p. 494 (Anders 6 rows from the bottom). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Han finns i dessa träd - KOLLAS ! !
2 CONT
