2 CONT Jonas i Rangedal, född omkring 1450 Reverend över hela Elfdalen 1480, antog den lutherska bekännelsen, dog vid hög ålder gifte sig 1537 med Bridget, en engelsk kvinna.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was first a "forsia," which meant the housekeeper or mistress of a Catholic priest.  When Jonas became a Lutheran, he and Birgitta married.  Son Ericus was born while his father was still a Catholic priest.
