1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Malin (or Magdalena) is the illegitimate daughter (frillodotter) of Anders and his girlfriend, cousin Gölug from Hälsingland. Anders (Andreas in Latin) was the priest (prest) in Skellefteå, 1499-1506. Since Malin's
2 CONC  parents were not married, she did not have the right to inherit from her father, Pastor (Kyrkoherden) Anders in Skellefteå. This was due to celibacy rule of Catholic canonical law. Therefore, Archbishop Jacob Ulfsson made an exce
2 CONC ption for Malin so that she could inherit his farm in Kåge [later called Storkåge] in the parish, which she received from her father from her father (from Bureätten Swedish Wikipedia article). 
2 CONT
2 CONT From Lundström: Malin's husband Anders Jakobsson was dead in 1539. She remarried to Per Tomasson from Degerbyn. He died 1553-04-01 and his homestead was taken over by his son-in-law Tomas Kettilsson, and husband to Kälug Andersdot
2 CONC ter, both our ancestors.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Dominus Andreas, biography, "Hernösands Stifts Herdaminne" (1925), pp. 298-99, https://runeberg.org/hernosandh/3/0300.html
2 CONT Mentioned with her husband, Anders Jakobsson, "De äldsta historiskt säkerställda släktmedlemmarna" section in  "Bureätten" (Bure Family), Sweden Wikipedia https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bureätten
2 CONT "Bure släkt" (Bure family), "Svenskt biografiskt lexikon," https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Mobil/Artikel/17152
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 512332
2 CONT Urban Sikeborg, "Johan Bures släktbok" USB (2017), person ID 1863.
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken 1539-1650" (2004), pp. 96-97, Storkåge 4 Granden.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Født i Kåge, Skellefteå. Gift 2 ganger. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Siden Malin Andersdotter mor og far ikke var gifte hadde hun ikke rett til å arve sin far Kyrkoherden i Skellefteå. Derfor gjorde Ærkebiskop Jacob Ulfsson et unntak for Malin slik at hun kunne arve sin far. Dette ble gjort i et br
2 CONC ev av 28.xm.xå
