1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sven Svensson was born 1717 at Backagård, Laske-Vedum to Sven Svensson and Kerstin Nilsdotter. Sven used Svensson for his surname, then used Lundgren as early as when his daughter Catharina was born in 1762. He was
2 CONC  gästgivare (innkeeper) at Vedum and died of a stroke.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Swen Swensson" and "Christina" appear on daughter Annika's baptism record as her parents.
2 CONT Widower Sven in Stommen, Laske-Vedum with his widower son Sven and children, Laske-Vedum AI:1.28 (1779-1800).
2 CONT
2 CONT Widower Sven's family, Stommen, Laske-Vedum, appear on the household exam record, Laske-Vedum AI:1.28 (1779-1800):
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Baptism record of Sven, Laske-Vedum, C.1.218 (1710-1791), https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0051333_00121
